%% NEXUS — same loop with explicit event names on transitions
%% Pairs with nexus/routing/ecology.py and activation rules

stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    [*] --> Observation

    Observation --> AnomalyCheck: observation.received
    AnomalyCheck --> BroadcastAnomaly: anomaly.detected
    AnomalyCheck --> Observation: (below threshold)

    BroadcastAnomaly --> ThoughtQuestion: engine.wake
    ThoughtQuestion --> HypothesisSpace: thought.emitted / question.emitted
    HypothesisSpace --> TheoryCompetition: hypothesis.proposed
    TheoryCompetition --> Experiment: theory.competition
    Experiment --> EvidenceGate: experiment.requested → evidence.assessed

    EvidenceGate --> Support: evidence.support
    EvidenceGate --> Falsify: evidence.falsify
    EvidenceGate --> Inconclusive: evidence.inconclusive

    Falsify --> HypothesisSpace: hypothesis.evolved
    Support --> Abstraction: abstraction.formed
    Abstraction --> Transfer: transfer.applied
    Transfer --> MetaCognition: memory.updated
    MetaCognition --> Observation: routing.policy_update

    Inconclusive --> ThoughtQuestion: reopen
